{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yululu-e-e706d67efd90f75f41f3","title":"同郡徐原爰居会稽，素不相识，临死遗书托孤于陆瑁","accounts":[{"id":"yululu-a-e706d67efd90f75f41f3","label":"正文","text":"同郡徐原爰居会稽，素不相识，临死遗书托孤于陆瑁","evidence":["yululu-q-4fdfdda8e6ff7baee14e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"yululu-p-292c72bed944d1","role":"遗书托孤","evidence":["yululu-q-4fdfdda8e6ff7baee14e"]},{"person":"zhanggu-p0033","role":"受托","evidence":["yululu-q-4fdfdda8e6ff7baee14e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["yululu-q-4fdfdda8e6ff7baee14e"]},"ordering_evidence":"yululu-q-4fdfdda8e6ff7baee14e","order":10227}],"persons":[{"id":"yululu-p-292c72bed944d1","name":"徐原（托孤陆瑁者）","evidence":["yululu-q-4fdfdda8e6ff7baee14e","yululu-q-9923c61a92d7754be290"],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"yululu-m-ba5d0694c7ba09b39232","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及徐原，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-9923c61a92d7754be290"]}],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yululu-q-4fdfdda8e6ff7baee14e","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-872a9bd72cf9cdbe3b15","layer":"original","quote":"及同郡徐原，爰居会稽〖4〗，素不相识；临死遗书，托以孤弱","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":373,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":74,"end":102},{"id":"yululu-q-9923c61a92d7754be290","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-872a9bd72cf9cdbe3b15","layer":"original","quote":"陆瑁字子璋。丞相逊弟也〖1〗。少好学笃义。陈国陈融、陈留濮阳逸、沛郡蒋纂、广陵袁迪等，皆单贫有志〖2〗，就瑁游处；﹝一﹞瑁割少分甘，与同丰约〖3〗。及同郡徐原，爰居会稽〖4〗，素不相识；临死遗书，托以孤弱。瑁为起立坟墓，收导其子。又瑁从父绩早亡，二男一女，皆数岁以还〖5〗；瑁迎摄养〖6〗，至长乃别。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":373,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":150}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
